<title>Australia: Australian national weather - July 1.</title>
<headline>Australian national weather - July 1.</headline>
<text>
<p>NATIONAL WEATHER: TUESDAY JULY 1, 1997</p>
<p>    CAIRNS.    Fine  25</p>
<p>    TOWNSVILLE............    Fine  24</p>
<p>    BRISBANE..............    Fine  20</p>
<p>    SYDNEY................    Showers  16</p>
<p>    CANBERRA..............    Shower or two  12</p>
<p>    MELBOURNE.............    Fog then fine  14</p>
<p>    HOBART................    Fine  11</p>
<p>    ADELAIDE..............    Fine  15</p>
<p>    DARWIN................    Fine  29</p>
<p>    PERTH.................    Fine  20</p>
<p>    ALICE SPRINGS.........    Fine  15</p>
<p>Reuters Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
